e9tablir des liens entre les diff\u00e9rentes tables relationnelles et pr\u00e9sente la base de donn\u00e9es des placettes-\u00e9chantillons temporaires en compl\u00e9ment.", "format": "PDF", "hash": "", "id": "26bfedb1-bffc-46b7-b1cb-4c7cf18956d2", "last_modified": "2024-12-31T12:00:00", "metadata_modified": "2025-07-17T18:42:47.577175", "mimetype": "application/pdf", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Guide d\u2019utilisation de la carte \u00e9coforesti\u00e8re originale et r\u00e9sultats d\u2019inventaire courants", "package_id": "adb12ba6-4e55-4e4a-8a63-235c48be7865", "position": 3, "relidi_condon_boolee": "n/a", "relidi_condon_datheu": "n/a", "relidi_condon_nombre": "n/a", "relidi_condon_valinc": "n/a", "relidi_confic_epsg": "n/a", "relidi_confic_pascom": "n/a", "relidi_confic_separateur_virgule": "n/a", "relidi_confic_utf8": "n/a", "relidi_description_champs": "n/a", "relidi_ressource_complementaire": [], "resource_type": "support", "size": null, "state": "active", "taille_entier": 6, "tracking_summary": {"total": 284, "recent": 10}, "url": "https://mrnf.gouv.qc.ca/documents/forets/inventaire/guide-donnees-dendometriques.pdf", "url_type": ""}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2022-06-23T15:35:08.851612", "datastore_active": false, "datastore_contains_all_records_of_source_file": false, "description": "## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Carte PDF\r\n<span style=\"display:block; height:1em; overflow:hidden;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> \r\n### Cette carte repr\u00e9sente la disponibilit\u00e9 de ce produit", "format": "PDF", "hash": "", "id": "8baee312-bfb6-4602-ab69-b18534085133", "last_modified": "2026-06-30T12:00:00", "metadata_modified": "2026-07-13T17:48:42.267407", "mimetype": "application/pdf", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Disponibilit\u00e9 des r\u00e9sultats de l\u2019\u00e9chantillonnage en for\u00eat", "package_id": "adb12ba6-4e55-4e4a-